---
import * as icons from "@grave/animated-icons/astro";
import { messageIcons } from "../../../../helpers/message-icons";
const sizes = [14, 16, 24, 28];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>Message recipe comparisons</title></head>
  <body>
    <h1>Message recipe comparisons</h1>
    <p>The reference runs the ten original Lucide Animated React components from revision 4662fff2b60fdcf4751b32013606756caf7c4c26. Their class utility import points to a local equivalent. React is confined to this comparison page.</p>
    <p>Hover a row or use its Replay button to animate both versions together. Play all starts every sample. Stop all returns them to rest. Seek pauses both versions at the selected time in the current playback.</p>
    <p>The adapters render complete SVG before JavaScript, respect reduced motion, and restore the drawing on removal. Native stroke dash lengths replace normalized path lengths. The simple bubbles use nested SVG groups around (12, 12) to reproduce the upstream SVG's independent scale and rotation while preserving interrupted spring velocity.</p>
    <p>Automated comparisons cover entry and returns from completed playback. Adapter interruption tests check continuity and cleanup separately. Seeking a native React animation does not rebase Motion's wall-clock sampling on stop, so a stop after seeking does not provide a reliable numerical reference for an interrupted return.</p>
    <button type="button" id="play">Play all</button>
    <button type="button" id="stop">Stop all</button>
    <label>Playback time in milliseconds <input id="time" type="number" value="200" min="0" max="3000" step="50" /></label>
    <button type="button" id="seek">Seek and pause</button>
    {messageIcons.map(icon => {
      const Component = icons[icon.name];
      return <section>
        <h2>{icon.name}</h2>
        <p><a href={`https://github.com/pqoqubbw/icons/blob/4662fff2b60fdcf4751b32013606756caf7c4c26/icons/${icon.slug}.tsx`}>Pinned upstream recipe</a> · <a href={`/${icon.slug}/`}>Manual controls and lifecycle</a></p>
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Astro adapter</th><th>Upstream React component</th><th>Playback</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>{sizes.map(size => <tr data-icon={icon.slug} data-size={size}>
            <th scope="row">{size} px</th>
            <td data-adapter><Component size={size} controlled /></td>
            <td><div data-reference data-name={icon.name} data-size={size}></div></td>
            <td><button type="button" data-replay aria-label={`Replay ${icon.name} at ${size} pixels`}>Replay</button></td>
          </tr>)}</tbody>
        </table>
      </section>;
    })}
  </body>
</html>

<script>
  import "../message-reference";
</script>
